    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking at the penthouse on 54. i'm ready to move forward if the place is solid, but i've heard some pretty specific things about recurring moisture and ceiling issues in that particular line. can u give me a straight answer—are there any recent or ongoing maintenance issues with the plumbing or ceilings in that unit or the one directly above it?",
